  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.NianticLightshipOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Niantic Lightship -- the industry-leading AR platform powering Pokemon GO and Ingress. Enables OASIS avatars and holons to be placed and experienced in the real world via AR overlays, VPS location anchors, and shared AR sessions. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 11 new OASIS providers — Maps (4), Blockchain (2), Network (3), Storage (2) (e1538d7)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Maps/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.NianticLightshipOASIS",
